  "source_task": "D1 09:00. I maintain a small open-source project. Our distributed package, README and changelog named the person who merged the code as its sole author, although one patch arrived through a verified proxy. Please correct the attribution using approved handles, preserve the working patch and reissue the corrected current package. By 11:00, send the actual version and digest to the four contributors and two downstream maintainers in their requested threads. Contributors may choose anonymous public credit. Do not infer anyone’s real name from a commit email."
